### Update Staking Pool (via Admin Service)
### Update an existing staking pool by pool ID
### Note: Only include fields you want to update. All fields are optional for updates.

### Update pool with all fields
PUT http://localhost:28080/api/admin/orchestration/staking/tiers/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "poolName": "1 Month Fixed Pool - Updated",
  "poolType": "FIXED_1_MONTH",
  "minStakeAmount": 500.0,
  "maxStakeAmount": 10000.0,
  "lockPeriodDays": 30,
  "apyPercentage": 9.0,
  "boostMultiplier": 1.5,
  "isActive": true,
  "description": "Updated 1 month fixed staking pool with 9% APY and 1.5x boost multiplier."
}

###

### Partial update - only update APY and boost multiplier
PUT http://localhost:28080/api/admin/orchestration/staking/tiers/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apyPercentage": 10.0,
  "boostMultiplier": 2.0
}

###

### Partial update - only update pool name and description
PUT http://localhost:28080/api/admin/orchestration/staking/tiers/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "poolName": "Premium 1 Month Pool",
  "description": "Premium staking pool with enhanced benefits"
}

###

### Update to change pool type and lock period
PUT http://localhost:28080/api/admin/orchestration/staking/tiers/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "poolType": "FIXED_3_MONTHS",
  "lockPeriodDays": 90,
  "apyPercentage": 12.0
}

###

### Deactivate a pool
PUT http://localhost:28080/api/admin/orchestration/staking/tiers/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

###

### Update using legacy fields (backward compatibility)
PUT http://localhost:28080/api/admin/orchestration/staking/tiers/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tierName": "Legacy Pool Name",
  "poolType": "FIXED_6_MONTHS",
  "minStakeAmount": 1000.0,
  "apBoostPerHour": 2.5
}

###

### Update minimum and maximum stake amounts
PUT http://localhost:28080/api/admin/orchestration/staking/tiers/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minStakeAmount": 200.0,
  "maxStakeAmount": 50000.0
}

###

### Update to remove maximum stake limit (set to null)
PUT http://localhost:28080/api/admin/orchestration/staking/tiers/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxStakeAmount": null
}

